WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:06.034
Mindwtr is free and open source, with the
Getting Things Done workflow built in.

00:00:06.359 --> 00:00:09.041
It works offline, with no account
required.

00:00:09.552 --> 00:00:12.989
Focus brings today and Next Actions
together.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.458
Capture first. Mindwtr recognizes dates
and organization as you type.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.383
Guided processing clarifies each capture.

00:00:27.766 --> 00:00:31.655
Quick mode keeps every decision on one
compact screen.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:35.503
Focus separates Today's Focus, Today, Next
Actions,

00:00:35.526 --> 00:00:39.148
and Upcoming, so you can engage with
confidence.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.901
Mindwtr stays simple by default, and
powerful when needed.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.819
Add checklist steps only when they matter.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.958
Keep a supporting link with the action,
then return to a clean task list.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:10.544
Projects hold outcomes. Sections organize
the work inside them.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:13.727
Turn sections into columns for a spatial
overview,

00:01:13.785 --> 00:01:16.780
and hide the project panel when you want
more room.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:23.812
Reorder a task, fold a section, or move
the section itself.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.951
Return to columns, and the new order is
preserved.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:38.587
Board view shows workflow status at a
glance.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.705
Cycle a context through include, exclude,

00:01:42.728 --> 00:01:46.037
and neutral to shape the board without
losing the rest.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.437
Hide the sidebar, pan across every status,

00:01:54.553 --> 00:01:57.584
and keep useful cards in a deliberate
order.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:09.047
Move a card to a new status, and the board
updates immediately.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.426
Month reveals the larger plan, with
completed work optional.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:23.626
Day and Week place timed work precisely,
and Week can show fewer or more days.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.415
Schedule becomes a scrollable agenda.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:33.658
Plan a Next Action, choose a duration, and
give it a start time.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.555
The scheduled result carries across Day,
Week, and Month.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.883
Weekly Review guides reflection one step
at a time.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.343
Start by clearing the Inbox.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:57.144
Surface stale actions before they
disappear into the system.

00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:01.344
Check the calendar, then follow up on
anything you're waiting for.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:13.416
Review contexts and active projects, then
revisit Someday ideas.

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:20.508
Finish with a manageable next step,
without scores or guilt.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.596
Optional AI is off by default and uses a
bring your own key,

00:03:24.678 --> 00:03:26.977
or BYOK, model.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:32.405
When enabled, Copilot can suggest a
context, time estimate, and reusable tag.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:37.049
Apply each part, or all at once, only when
it helps.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:43.078
During Weekly Review, optional AI can
analyze stale Next and

00:03:43.136 --> 00:03:48.070
Waiting items and suggest a safer next
decision before anything changes.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.912
Mindwtr includes multiple theme options,

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:03.012
so your workspace feels calm and personal.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:08.308
Light keeps every view crisp, spacious,
and easy to scan.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:19.440
Dark lowers glare while workflows stay
calm and focused.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:22.637
Themes change the atmosphere, not the
philosophy:

00:04:23.079 --> 00:04:26.155
simple, powerful, and forgiving.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:31.271
Stay fully local, or choose Dropbox, a
shared folder,

00:04:31.329 --> 00:04:34.499
WebDAV, or your own server, with optional
encryption.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:38.342
You decide which preferences travel across
devices.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:49.084
Export a full backup, CSV, or Task Notes
Markdown;

00:04:49.235 --> 00:04:54.181
restore or merge later, and import from
Todoist, TickTick, and more.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:59.074
Capture, clarify, organize, reflect,

00:04:59.097 --> 00:05:02.638
and engage across Windows, Mac, Linux,
iPhone,

00:05:02.719 --> 00:05:06.481
Android, and the web, without giving up
control of your data.
